IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ro-orders`

-- Restraining Orders Act 1997 (WA), Parts 1B, 2, 2A Div 3A, 3, ss 4-7, 50, 50A, 61-61B -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_wa_restraining-orders-act-1997_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

-- Life facts: workbench scenario au/wa/cradle-to-grave-jake/facts.json, event k063 (22 August 2036, Jake aged 29). The
-- scenario does not say what the paint said or how old the lender is; the fixtures ASSUME, as the WA Criminal Code baseline
-- does, that the paint demanded the friend's debt (a threat of detriment, not of injury), and that the lender is an
-- individual of 45. Variants show what changes the answer.

