§ `ss 4, 5A, 6 -- family relationship, family violence, personal violence`

#ASSERT NOT `Are we in a family relationship` `strangers: Jake and the unlicensed lender`
#ASSERT `Are we in a family relationship` `former de facto partners`

#ASSERT `Has the respondent committed family violence against me` `former de facto partners` `the same paint and glue, done by a partner to frighten`
#ASSERT NOT `Has the respondent committed family violence against me` `strangers: Jake and the unlicensed lender` `the same paint and glue, done by a partner to frighten`

#ASSERT NOT `Has the respondent committed personal violence against me` `strangers: Jake and the unlicensed lender` `k063: paint demanding the debt, the lock glued`
#ASSERT `Has the respondent committed personal violence against me` `strangers: Jake and the unlicensed lender` `paint threatening to hurt the family`
#ASSERT `Has the respondent committed personal violence against me` `strangers: Jake and the unlicensed lender` `a stranger who claims a relationship I deny, and frightens me`

§ `ss 7, 10D, 11A, 12A, 34, 35A, 50 -- which order (k063)`

#ASSERT `Must the court make the FVRO` `k063 variant: the same paint by Jake's former partner`
#ASSERT NOT `Must the court make the FVRO` `k063 variant: former partner, special circumstances`

#ASSERT NOT `Can a court make a VRO for me` `k063: Jake against the unlicensed lender`
#ASSERT `Can a court make a VRO for me` `k063 variant: the paint threatened to hurt the family`

#ASSERT `Can a court make an MRO for me` `k063: Jake against the unlicensed lender`
#ASSERT NOT `Can a court make an MRO for me` `k063 variant: no order appropriate`

#ASSERT `Which restraining order can protect me` `k063: Jake against the unlicensed lender` EQUALS `a misconduct restraining order`
#ASSERT `Which restraining order can protect me` `k063 variant: the paint threatened to hurt the family` EQUALS `a violence restraining order`
#ASSERT `Which restraining order can protect me` `k063 variant: the same paint by Jake's former partner` EQUALS `a family violence restraining order`
#ASSERT `Which restraining order can protect me` `k063 variant: the lender is a company` EQUALS `none: the respondent is not an individual or is under 10`
#ASSERT `Which restraining order can protect me` `k063 variant: the paint was done by a child of 9` EQUALS `none: the respondent is not an individual or is under 10`
#ASSERT `Which restraining order can protect me` `a neighbour the court is satisfied of nothing about` EQUALS `none on what the court is satisfied of`

