#ASSERT `Can I get a telephone order` `a VRO` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Can I get a telephone order` `an MRO` TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT NOT `Can I get an interim order before the respondent is heard` `an MRO`
#ASSERT `Can I get an interim order before the respondent is heard` `an FVRO`

